.TITLE "groups"

.DIV "DESCRIPTION"
Displays the names of the groups that a user belongs to. It is used to __verify permissions__ and access rights associated with different group memberships.

.DIV "TLDR"
**groups**
Displays the group memberships for the current user.
> 

**groups user**
Displays the group memberships for a specific user.
> __user__ the target username

.DIV "SUMMARY"
Group memberships determine what files and devices you can access. If you have recently been added to a new group, you may need to __log out and back in__ for the changes to take effect in your current session.

.DIV "SEE ALSO"
**linux:id** **linux:usermod** **linux:chgrp**

